<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">1 K'orontos</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 K'orontos</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 K'orontos Ashwots Maants</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 K'or.</para>
  <para style="mt3">Wosheetso P'awlos Shints Wosho</para>
  <para style="mt">K'orontos Ashuwots Maants</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">P'awlos K'orontos dats ashuwotssh b́ guut'ts shints wosho b́ guut'e K'orontositse b́ need'its Ik'i moowutse krstiyani beyonat imnetiyatse tuut teshts kic'oosh biitso daatsiyosh gawutni. Manoor K'orontos dats jamaatsik wotts Grik kitu bwottsi danmbaatse Akayiya eteets Rom datsatsi kitti enuni btesh. Kitman een wotts jaaki fino, matseets niwo, ayidek'at gawunoke teshts fini gondannat biitse haymanoti ayon daneeki btesh.</para>
  <para style="ip">Woshetso b́ t'iwints Ik'i moowwutse teshts kayeyaatsa, gond finets beyo, widonat de'eyi jangono, S'ayin shayiri imi jangonat k'irotse tuwi janga b́tesh, mank'owere woshetso doo shishiyi jangosh aatets keewanots kaatsdek't t'iwintsona b́t'intsi.</para>
  <para style="ip">«Shuno» Ik'o b́ shuntswots ashuwotssh b́ imts imuwotsitse bogo b́wottsok'owo kitsiru tatse keezl k'ot'o mas'afanitse ayidek't daneek wotts kayo b́wotok'o daneke.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1-9</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstiyaniwotsitse tuuts kayewo 1:10—4:21</para>
  <para style="io1">T'awu gondtsi wotonat meyitsi ash beyon 5:1—7:40</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstiyaaniwotsnat krstiyaniyots amantsman de'awwotsn 8:1—11:1</para>
  <para style="io1">Ik'i meyitsi beyonat Ik' ik'iyi niwon 11:2—14:40</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstosnat amantsuwotsn k'irotse tuwo 15:1-58</para>
  <para style="io1">Yhuditse fa'a kic'ts krstiyaniwotssh tep'o 16:1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Gúúpo 16:5-24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Ik' shunon Iyesus Krstossh wosheets wotosh s'eegetso P'awlosnat no eshu Sostensokere.<verse eid="1CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>K'orontos kitotse fa'a Ik' moosh, biyitsnowere Iyesus Krstosn S'ayin wotts S'ayin bowotish s'eegetswotssh, mank'owero bo be beyoke, bonat nonsh Doonz wottso no Doonz Iyesus Krstos shúútso s'eegiru jamwotssh.<verse eid="1CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>No nihi Ik'onat Doonzo Iyesus Krstosokere s'aatonat jeenon itsh wotowe.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik' údo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Iyesus Krtosnton s'aato itsh imetsosh it jangosh jam aawo Ik'o údituwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Jam keewon, noon keewon wotowa danon Krstosn gaalwutserte. <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>Krstos jangosh itsh t keewts gawo itokere kúp'ere. <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>Eshe no Doonz Iyesus Krstos be'ewo koton nobefere kon naari shayiri imo itsh shapratse, <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>No doonz Iyesus Krstos aani woor eeg eeg deshawwotsi wotar nodatsetwok'o bí s'uwosh b́ borfetsosh kup'ar it beetuewk'o woshúwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>B́ naay no Doonz Iyesus Krstosnton ikwoto itdetsetuwok'o itn s'eegtso Ik'o amaneke.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstiyaniwots dagotse k'alewo b́geyirawok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Ti eshuwotso! «K'alewo it dagotse b́ berawok'o, it jamets shiyeyar ik níbonat ik s'iil s'iilon kup'ar beewere,» etaat no Doonz Iyesus Krstos shúútson itn k'oniruwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>T eshuwotso! it dagotse fayo b́ beyiruwok'o K'elo'e maa ashuwotsoke shishre. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:24">Wosh. 18:24</ref> </char></note> Manuwere it itok tookon «Taa P'awlosk taane, taa Ap'losk taane, taa P'et'rosk taane, taa Krstosk taane» it etiri. <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Bére Krstos kayera? P'awlos itsh jiitera? Himó it gupe P'awlos shútsoneya? <verse eid="1CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:8">Wosh. 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16:23</ref> </char></note> Taa K'ersp'osnat Gayyosiyere okoon ititsere konnoru t gufawotse Ik'o údituwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>Eshe «Taan P'awlos shútson guuperte» err keewosh falituwo aaliye. [ <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 16:15">1 K'or. 16:15</ref> </char></note> Arikee, Ist'ifanos maa ashuwotsi gupre, maniyere okoon k'osho taa t gupts asho b́ bewok'o gawratse.] <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Krstos taan b́wosh doo shishi keewo t danituwok'owa bako t gupishaliye, Krstos jiito<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jiita: </char><char style="ft">Eteetso mask'aliyoniye. </char></note> hank'on b́ oorerawok'o doo shishi keewan tdanir ashoke daatsets dani telfi noon keewok'onaliye.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstos Ik' danitelefonat ango b́ woto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>B́ jiti keewo t'afit ashuwotssh darok'owe b́ taaweti, noosh kashituwotsshomó Ik' angee.<verse eid="1CO 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:14">Isa. 29:14</ref> </char>
    </note> «Dani telefetswots dano t'afituwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">Dani telefetswots danono ok k'aaú bazetuwe» ett guut'ere.<verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:17">Iyo. 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:12">Isa. 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:18">33:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:25">44:25</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshe dantso aawoke b́ fa'oni? Nem daniruwonu aawoke b́ fa'oni? Danosh geyiruwonu aawoke b́ fa'oni? Ik'o datsanatsi dani telefo eegoru bítse dandeshawok'o woshk'rerosha?<verse eid="1CO 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Datsnatsi ashuwots bo took danitelefon Ik'o danosh bo falawok'o Ik'o b́ danon boats is'k'rere, ernmó dárok'o taaweyiru no nodaniru doo shishiy keewon amanituwots bo kashituwok'o Ik' shún wotere. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Ayihudiyots adits keewo bek'oshe bo geefoni, Girik ashuwotswere danitelefe bogefoni. <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>Noomó Krstos noosh b́ jitetsok'oniye no daniri, Hanuwere ayhudiyotssh t'uge, Grik ashuwotssh dáree. <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>S'eegetswotsshomó ayhudiyotssh wotowa Grik ashuwotssh, Krstos Ik' angonat Ik' danitelefe. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Ik' dára ett gaweyiru keewo ash danitelefoniyere bogfe, Ik'o maawa ett gaweyiru keewo ash kup'oniyere bogfe.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>T eshuwotso! Ik'o itn b́ s'eegor awuk'o ash it wottsok'o aab gawde'ere, ash gaawiruwok'on it dagotse aywots daanetsuwots wee kúp'uwots wee een een ashuwots aalne. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Ik'o dantelfetswotsi jitsiyosh datsanatse dartsok'o taawets ashuwotsi b́ marat'i, kúp'uwotsi jitsiyosh datsatse maawtsok'o taawetswotsi b́ marat'i, <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>Ik'o datsatsi ashuwotsoke fa'ane ett be'eyiru keewwotsi bo berawok'o woshosh datsanatse dash antsonat gac'ets k'awnts deshaw keewo b́ marat'i. <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>Hanowere b́k'al konwor asho Ik' shinatse b́ tooko dambaan b́deshawok'owe. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Itnomó Ik'o Iyesus Krstosnton ik woto it detsetwok'o b́ woshi, mansh Ik'o Iyesus Krstosn noko danitelefo bíne, noosh noko kááwo bíne, no s'ayinonat no bín nofaritwok'o b́ woshi. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Erm. 9:24</ref> </char></note> Eshe mas'aafotse guut'etsok'on «It'etuwo b́ beyal Ik'on id'ee.»<verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="s">Jitetso Krstos jango daniyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Ti eshuwotso! taa itok twoor Ik' jango itsh t gawutso,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">T gawutso: </char><char style="ft">Ik ik brani mas'afwotsitsere «Ik' keewo kishde'er daniya bo etfo.» </char></note> keew falonat bog dan kitsonaliye. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Itnton t beyor Iyesus Krstosiyere oko dab jitats jiteyat b́ k'ironiyere k'osho eegoru tdanawok'osh k'ut'dek'atniye t teshi. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Eshe itnton t beyor maawk wotat shatonat ay k'eewone tteshi. <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>T noon keewonat nabo ash danitelefonat noon keew shawshats b́ woterawo Ik' shayiri angaats tep'ekee b́teshi. <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>Hanowere tk'altso it imnetiyo ash danitelefats b́ woterawo ik' angaats te'ek b́ wotishee.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik' dani telefo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Ernmó bo shayiri beyon katsuwotssh dantelefi aap'o keewituwone, wotowa eree nokeewitwo datsanatsi danitelefon wee s'uwatse t'afosh wotit datsan k'eeziruwots danitelefoniyaliye. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>No no keewiruwonmó Ik'o yoots dúroniye shinon no mangosh b́ k'anitsonat aashat teshts Ik' danitelefoniye. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Datsni k'eziruwitsitsere danitelefo dantso konworu aaliye, danfno wotik'ee mang wotts Doonzo jirawuk'ne b́ tshi. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 64:4">Isa. 64:4</ref> </char></note> Wotowa eree mas'aafo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">«Ash ááw be'awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">Ash waaz shiyawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">Ash nib gawawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">Ik'o b́ shúntswotssh k'anire» etfe.<verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Nooshmó Ik'o b́ shayiron aashts man kitsre, Ik' shayiro dashan wokts Ik'oke aashtsonoru b́ oreraniyere jam keewo p'ec'at b́ s'iili. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Ash iko jangosh b́ took shayironiyere okoon b́ gawiruwo dantso kone? mank'o Ik' shayironiyere okoon Ik' gawiruwo dantso konuworu aaliye. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Ik'oke noosh b́ imets keewo nodanish Ik' shayira bako datsanatsi shayiro de'atsone.<verse eid="1CO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Eshe no shayiri keewo shayiron wotts ashuwotssh no danir ashokere daatsets danitelefon b́ woterawo Ik' shayirokere daatsets dantelefone. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Ik' shayiro deshaw meets ashonmó Ik' shayiroke imeyiru imo dek'osh falatse, bí im eenonuwere p'ec'ar b́s'ilet Ik' shayiron b́wottsotse t'iwints dek'osh falatse, hanuwere bísh darok'owe woshder b́ s'ileti. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Ik' shayir detsts jamonmó jam keewo p'ec'ar s'iilo falituwe, b́ took keewonomó konuwor p'ec'ar s'iilo falatse. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa. 40:13</ref> </char></note> Hanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">«Doonzo gawiruwo kone danosh faliti?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">Bísh izosh falituwo kone?» Ett guut'etsok'one.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Noomó Krstos nibo detsfone.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ik'o guutswotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>T eshuwotso! taa iti t daniyor meets asho Krstosats kúp'eraw na'i marmat'ok'o it wottsok'ona bako shayiretswotsk'o it wottsoshaliye. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 5:12-13">Ibr. 5:12-13</ref> </char></note> Kúp' mish moo máá falaaw na'i marmat'ok'o it wottsotse taa itsh t maanztso ezaa bako kúp' mishaliye, andoor b́ wotiyal kúp' mish moo falrafa'ate. <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>It andoru meets ash itne, it ats atseyo it okoreyirwotsnat it mosheyirwotse meets ash itnosha? it finirwore k'osh ashok'owosha? <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:12">1 K'or. 1:12</ref> </char></note> Iko «Taa P'awlosk taane» k'osho «Taa Ap'losk taane» bí etor datsanatsi ash itnosha? <verse eid="1CO 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>wotowa bako Ap'los kone? P'awlos kone? boowere it itk'alirwok'o k'alts guutsne, botook tookon bo finir Doonzo botook tookon boosh b́ eezts finoniye, <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:4-11">Wosh. 18:4-11</ref> </char></note> Taa ttooki, Ap'los aatso b́ ishi, eenshtsonmó Ik'oniye. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Eshe bos'man enshtso Ik'oni bako tooktsonu aats ishirwonu eegnaliye. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Tooktso wotowa aats ishtsonu taalne, bo took tookon bofintsok'o bo k'awntso dek'etune. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>No Ik'osh tohar finit guutswots noone, itmó Ik' goshonat Ik' agiru maa itne. <verse eid="1CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Ik' taash b́imts s'aatok'on maa agiru s'ekok'o agoko need'itdek'i, koshonu taa need'itsmanats bíagi, ernmó ik iko manats awuk'o bíagiruwok'o t'iwintso bísh geyife. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Ikn ned'yetsmantsere okoon konuworu k'osho ned'iyosh falatse, need'yokanwere Iyesus Krstosiye. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Ned'okanats awntson, wee ambaron wee k'awunts shaaw shúútson, mitoon, tootson wee buyon agetuwo b́beyal <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>ik ik asho b́ fino b́be'et angshiy aawo weetuwe, manots aaw ik ik asho b́ fino awuk'o b́ wotok'o tawon fadere be'etuwe. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Gmbi agf iko bíagtso tawon b́fadeyor mic'aniyere b́ oriyal b́ k'awntso daatsituwe. <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>B́ fino tawon mic'r t'afitu agtsonmó t'ut'etuwe, wotoa eree bí b́tookon tawotse beshat mic'aniyere oorts ashok'o kashituwe.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:19">1 K'or. 6:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 K'or. 6:16</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik' maa it wottsok'onat Ik' shayiro ititse b́ beyiruwok'o danatsteya? <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Eshe asho Ik' moo b́ gakal Ik'o bín gaketuwe, Ik' mooniye S'ayine, Ik' maa S'aynwotswere itne.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Konworu b́ tooko ant'elck'aye, datsanatse danitelefetso araar be'etwo fa'e wotiyal Ik'oki arik wottso danitelefo b́datsish b́ tooko dartsok'o taawwe. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Iyo. 5:13</ref> </char></note> Datsatsi danitelefo Ik' shinatse dáree, hanu, «Ik'o dani telefetswotsi bogond finon detsetwe» ett guut'etsok'one. <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Dub. 94:11</ref> </char></note> Hank'owere, «Doonzo dani telefetsuwots asaabiyo k'awuntso b́deshawok'o danfee» ettso guut'ere.<verse eid="1CO 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Eshe jam keewo itk b́wottsotse konworu ashon it'k'aye. <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>P'awlosi wotowa, Ap'losi b́ wotowa, P'et'rosi wotowa, Datsan wotowa, kasho wotowa, k'iro wotowa, and beyiruwo wotowa, shuuts wetuwo wotowa, jámonwor itkee. <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>Itmó Krstos nanaúwots itne, Krstoswere Ik' na'ee.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Krstos guutswots</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Eshe ash jámo noon Krstos guutswotsi nowottsok'o Ik'oke aashtso kitso adaro boosh imetswotsk'o woshde noon taawwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Adar dek'tswotswere amanetswotsi wotar daatsewo boosh geyife. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>T jangosh b́wotitka wotiyal itwoor tiyats itangshiyal wee k'osh asho tiyats b́angshiyal eegonor kic'eratse, arikon taawor dab ttookats angsho falatse. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Taa tdantsok'oyi wotiyal tnibo taan gac'eratse, hanuwere taa s'ayin twottsok'owo kitsratse, ernmó tiyats angshituwo doonzo s'uziye. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Mansh bíaawo b́ borawo, doonzo angshosh b́waftsere shino konatsor angshk'ayere, bí b́woor t'aluwotse ááshtso mist'iriyo shanomaants kishituwe, ashuwots nibotse ááshts hasabiyo kishituwe, manoor ik ikon Ik'oke bísh wotit údono daatsituwe.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Eshuwwotso! iti t'ak'amosha etaat keewanats taanat Ap'losi aridek'at tkeewi, hanowere tk'al «Guut'etsatse beshk'aye» etiru izi biitso no atse it danetuwok'wa etaatniye, mansh ash ikon it'o k'oshonowere gac'o geyiratse itsha. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Nee k'oshuwotsiyere eegneya nbogi? K'oshoke nde'aw keewo eebi fa'oni? Eshe jam keewo k'oshoke ndek'ka wotiyal de'aw ashok'o eegoshe n it'iri.?<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Andere itsh geyiru keew jamo daatsrte, andere galetswotsi wotertee, no atse k'aleyat naashwtserte, arikon it naashka wotink'ere, noowere itnton toowar nonaashitwotse it naashonuwere sheenge b́wotiyank'oni, <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Ik'o noon b́woshtswotsi k'iro boatsats angshr bo úd'etuwoki beewok de'amet ashuwotsitse shutstsuwotsi noon b́wooshtsok'o arefee, manatse tuutso dats jamatse melakiwotsnat ashuwots shinatse miis'i mit wotatniye nobe'eyiri, <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Noo Krstos jangosha etaat dogwotsi woterone, itmó Krstosn ayidek'at dantsuwotsi wotwutserte, mank'owere noo mawtswotsi woterone, itmó kup'uwotsi woterte, it mangiyeyirwotsi woterte, noomó keteyeyiruwotsi woterone. <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>And b́ wotiyaloru and sa'atansh b́ borfetso nok'ak'iri, no shashúwiri, no aratsiri, no jot'eyiri beyoko t'út'at hake bako nojawriri. <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Wosh. 18:3</ref> </char></note> No kishon finat ango nomaawiri, noon bo c'ashor noderiri, noon bo gishor no k'amiri, <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>noon boc'ashonat noshútso bot'afiyor maac' nefon boosh no aaniri, andish b́ borfetso datsanatse juwetsok'onat datsatse fokets kímo woterone.<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Taa han itsh tguut'ir shuneets tnana'úwotsk'o woshdek'at izosh gawatni bako iti jiitsiyo geyatniyaliyee. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Krstosn jishiru ayuwotsi it detsalor nih ayuwotsi deshatste, taayere itn Iyesus Krstos doo shishiyon shuure. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Mansh tjafro sha'ar taan it arituwok'o iti k'oniruwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16-17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 11:1">1 K'or. 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Filp. 3:17</ref> </char></note> Hanatse tuutson shuneetsonat amanets doonzon t naayi wottso T'imotiyosi itsh woshere, b́ be beyokenowere Ik'i maa mooke t daniyirwok'o bí taa Krstosn t daatsts handr beyon bín it jishetuwo itsh gawituwe.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Ernmó ititse ik ikuwots taa itn s'iilo twarawok'o boosh bí arere kofangon s'eenwtserne. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Ernmó doonzon tooh karn aawotse itok weetuwe, manoor kofangirwanots bo noon keew s'uzi b́woterawo bokúp' kúp'onor dano geefe. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Ik'i mengsto noon keewi kis' b́ woterawo Ik'i kúp'e. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>It geyirwo eebi? Sezi gumbo de'er it maants twoo geeftee? Himo shunonat tooko dashan detsi shayiron twoone it geyi?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Amantsuwotsitse finets gond fino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Ititse jitsits widi fino b́beyok'o keeweyiruwe, han naari widi fino dab Ik'i ash woterawwotsoke k'alekaliye, manuwere b́ nih máátsu máátsok'o woshdek't beyiruwo fa'ee eteefe. <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Eshe, hank'o jitsits keewo ititse b́ befere eegoshe bognone etaat it míshiri? Maniyere dab keewanatse tuutso shiyano itsh geyiratsa? Han naari fino fints asho ititse kishuwere. <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Taa meetson dab itnton woto tk'azalor shayiron itntoniye tfa'oni, ar itnton tbeyiruk'o wotde'er han naari fino k'alts ashaats Doonzo Iyesus shúútson angshuwere, <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>It kakwewor taawere nodoonz Iyesus angon it dagotse shayiron tdaatsetuwotse, <verse eid="1CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>Morron s'eents ashaan meetso b́ gáhituwok'o Shed'anosh imo itsh geyiyank'ee. Han it k'alitwere doonzo Iyesus angshosh b́weyi aawots ashaan kashu bkashituwok'wee.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Eshe it it'o shengaliye, boot' shash múk'naú boot' jamo b́ shashituwok'o danatsteya? <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>And it wotts jamok'o boot' shasho bítse deshaw handr boot'ok'o it wotish boot'i nato ok juuk'rore, nofazigi mereer wottso Krstos shukeere, <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Mansh gondonat gondon s'eents boot'i shashon b́woterawo boot' shasho bítse deshaw kaawonat ari tushon nobaaliyo mangiwone.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Haniyere shin itsh tguut'ts woshatse gobetswotsnton ik wotk'ayere etreb́teshi. <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Han tietoorowere b́ jamon datsanatsi gobetsuwotsatse wee jaalets ashuwotsatse wee úmp'etswotsatse wee woteraw Ik'o ik'iyrwotston iko wotk'ayere etaliye, mank'o b́wotink'ere datsuatse kesho itsh geyife etee. <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Taayere itsh tguut' krstiyaniyotsi etefere wido sha'iruwotsnton, k'awntiruwotsnton, Woteraw Ik'o ik'iruwotsnton, wee ash shúúts t'afiruwotsnton, wee mashiruwotsnton, wee biik'iruwotsnton ik wotk'ayere etniye. Hanotsk'o ashuwotsnton towaar maak'ayere. <verse eid="1CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Krstiyaniwots mabariyoniyere úre fa'a ashuwotsats angshosh kone taa? Krstiyaniwots mabariyatse fa'úwotsatsnmó itwoor angsho faliyalkitneya? <verse eid="1CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Úratse fa'a ashuwots jango angshituwo Ik'oniye, eshe mas'aafo bíetiruwok'on «Gond asho ititse kishuwere.»<verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s">Krstiyaniwots dagotse fa'a fayo awuk'on baziyetuwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Ititsere iko bí eshu amantsonton b́ fayeyal b́ keewman amantsuwots angshon bísh bo s'iiletwok'o b́ k'aloniyere s'amiyosh Ik' ash woteraw angshiruwots shinats daamosh ááweya b́ shúk'eti? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Ik' ashuwots datsatsi ashaats bo angshituwok'o danatsteya? eshe, datsanatse angshiruwots it wotor keew muk'anats angshosh maawituteya? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Melakiwotsats dab it angshitwok'o danatsteya? eshe, datsanatsi keewwotsats bogshde aawuk'oneya angsho nomaawiti? <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Eshe it took tookon it fayeyal krstyaniwots ik mabariyoniyere úratsi gac'ets ashuwots shinats bokeew man aawuk'oneya it t'intsituteya? <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Hano tíetir it jitsituwok'owa etaatniye, wotowa ére eshuwotsitsere angsh falitu dants eenasho datseyalkeya? <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Eshe, ik krstiyaniyo k'osh krstiyaniyo s'amir Ik' ashwoterawwotsok angshi moots daamo geyiyituwa?<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Eshe it took tookon s'amiyeyar mooshewo b́tookon itsh it took keetiye, maniyere iti dadewo k'aneratsa? mank'o iti dirshewo k'aneratsa? <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Itmó it eshuwotsi wotts krstiyaaniwotsnoor dadaat itdirshiri. <verse eid="1CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Eshe weergondetswots Ik'i mengsto bonaarawok'o danftooshna? Keewhan jangatsno daand k'ayere, gusiyetswots, wee woteraw Ik'o ik'iruwots, wee gobetsuwots, wee gad'ayirwots, <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>Wee úmp'etswots, wee jaaletswots, wee máshetsuwots, wee ash shúúts t'afifuwots, wee biik'tswots Ik'i mengsto naaratsno. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Ititsnor ik ikuwots mank'o itne b́teshi, andmó Doonzo Iyesus Krstos shútsonat noko Izar Izewer shayiron morrotse mash bazrte, Ik'osh gaalets S'ayin ashuwotsi wotat, kááwerte.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Atsi meetso Ik'o mangosh jitso b geyitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:23">1 K'or. 10:23</ref> </char>
    </note> «Jam keewo taash baziyeratse,» ernmó jamkeewo taash t'ak'amituwe etaliye, jam keewo taash baziyeratse, wotowa ére keew jamosh guuts wotarr kéweratse, <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>«Misho maac'osha, maac'onwere mishooshe,» bere Ik'o, mishonowere, maac'onowere t'afituwe, ernmó no atso Doonzo Iyesussh, Doonzo Iyesuswere no atsosh b́wottsotse noatso widosh wosho geyiratse. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Ik'o Doonzo Iyesusi k'irotse tuuzre, nonowere bíangon k'irotse tuuzituwe. <verse eid="1CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>It atso Krstos atsi k'at' b́ wottsok'o danatsteya? Eshe Krstos aatsi kayo de'er gobets maatsu aatsi kayo b́ wotituwok'o wosho taash geyifa? B́ jamon woteratse! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Aze. 2:24</ref> </char></note> Máátsok gobo amr binton k'etuwo bínton ik atso bo wotituwok'o danatsteya? «Gituwots ik atse bo wotiti» ett guut'ere. <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Doonzo Iyesusnton ik wotit ashonmó bínton shayiron ik wotituwe.<verse eid="1CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Mansh widatse wokoore, asho b́finiru k'osh morr jamo b́took atsoniyere okoone b́ finiri wid amiru ashonmó b́ took aatsatse morro b́finiri, <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 K'or. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 K'or. 6:16</ref> </char></note> It atso Ik'oke it dek'tsonat ititse beyiru S'ayin shayirosh Ik' maa b́ wotok'o danatsteya? Eshe it Ik'k itna bako it tokik itnaliye. <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>Bíwere itn k'awuntson keewere, mansh it aatson Ik'o mangiwere.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s">Amantsuwots de'eyi jagosh izets izo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Taash guut'at it attso, asho máátsonton gonkewo b́k'azink'ere shege. <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Ernmó widatse wokoosh nungush ik iko b́ took máátso de'e, mááts ik ikunu b took kenihosh máátso amiye. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Keniho b́máátsush k'alo bín geyitu de'eyi niwo bísh bazik'aye, mank'o máátsu bkenihsh k'alo bish geyit de'eyi niwo bísh bazik'ayiye. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Máátsu bi atsatse alo deshatsane, biatsatse alo detstso b kenihiye. Mank'owere keniho bíatsatse alo deshatse, bí atsatse alo detstsu máátsuniye. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Kup'ar Ik' k'onosh it gitets ik wotde manorush b́wotiyala bako k'aleyon iko ikosh de'eyi niwo bazik'aye. Manatse tuutson it tooko kordek'o maawr it eree shed'ano it ats fadewo b́doorawok'o aani towaar wotoore. <verse eid="1CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Han itsh tietir izook'owa bako tzaziyok'owaliye. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Ash jamo tikok'o máátso b́de'aawo b́beyink'ere shunfee b́teshi, ernmó Ik'o ik ikosh k'osh k'osh imo imre, iko ik naari imo, k'oshnuwere k'osh imo detsfe.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>De'erawwotsnat bokenih k'irts máátswotssh tietetuwo hank'oyiye, bode'erawo tikok'o wotarr bobeyink'ere sheenge. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Ernmó meetsi tewnon mis'oniyere de'ewo b́k'antsotse botoko kordek'o bomawiyal de'ewne.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>De'etsuwotsshmó t'imet tzaziyo haniye, tzaziyanwere Doonzoka bako tikaliye, dek'ets máátsu bkenihatse fakshek'ayiye. <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>B faksheeyalowere máátso amaniyere bíyal beewiye, wee bkenihnton maneewiye, mank'owere keniho b́máátsu fakshk'aye.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>K'oshuwotsshmó doonzo b́woterawo taa ttookon t etiruwo hank'owiye, krstiyani ash iko krstiyani woteraw máátsu b́detsal err towaar beyo bgeyiyal fakshk'aye. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Krstiyani wotts máátsu krstiyani woteraw kenihodetsfawotiyal binton towaar beyo b́geyiyal keshk'ayiye. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Krstiyani woteraw keniho krstiyan wotts b́máátsu atse tuutson Ik'i jir wotituwe, krstiyani woteraw máátsunwere krtiyani wotts kenihoatse tuutson Ik'i jir wotituwane, mank'o wotob́k'azink'ere it nana'úwots Ik'i ashuwotsi wotofalrawnk'nee, mank'oon it beyalmó it nana'úwots Ik'i ashuwotsiye. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Krstiyani woterawo fakshewo b́geyiyal fakshewe, mank'onmó krstiyaniwo mantstso kenih wotowa máátso eegi naari keewon detseratse. Ik'o noon b́s'eeg jeenon nobetuwok'owe. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Nee krstiyani máátsune, krstiyani woterawo nkenihi daneraka nworitka wotiyal eege ndani? Neewere krstiyani nungushono, krstiyani woteraw nmáátsu nworitka wotiyal eege ndani?<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'o b́ s'eegor boteshtsok'on kúp'o b́geyituwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Ik iko Doonzo b́ imts imok'onat b́ s'eegeori b́teshtsok'on beewe, Ik'i moowwotssh ti imtso bín bojisheetuwo haniye. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Asho konuwor wotowa gofo bíamiyak s'eegeka wotiyal gofo amawok'o wotosh gawuk'aye, gofo bíamawo s'eegeka wotiyalo gofamo geek'aye. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Gof amonu gof amk'azonuwere k'awuntso deshatse, Ik'o tzaziyo korde'er finats jitsoniye k'awtsetsoni. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Mansh asho ik ikon Ik'o bín b́ s'eegor b́teshtsok'on beewe. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Ik'o neen b́ s'eegor guutse nteshi? Nwotiyalor eegor woteratse, mansh kic'k'aye, nas' keshi goo ndatsitka wotiyal goo man neesh beshk'aye. <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Guuts wotat b́befere Doonzon s'eegets asho Doonzon nas' keshke, mank'owere nas'o wotat b́befere s'eegets asho Krstossh guutse. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Ik'o k'awuntson iti b́kewutsotse ashuwots guutso wotk'ayere. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Mansh tíeeshwotso asho ik ikon b́ seegeyori b́teshtsok'on Ik'onton mank'oon beewe.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">De'erawwotsnat bokenih k'irts máátsuwots jangosh t'intsets aato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>De'eraw ashuwots jangosh Doonzoke tdek'ts tzaziyo deshatse, ernmó doonzo mhretyon amanek twottsotse ttook asaabiyo hanats dabr tt'intsitwoniye.<verse eid="1CO 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>And nobeyiru gizeyo kic'its gize b́wottsotse de'eraniye bíyal beyo sheeng arefee taasha, <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>B́woteferowere máátso dek'ri wotiyal faksho geek'aye, máátso de'atsne wotiyal dek'osh geek'aye. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Ernmó nee máátso ndek'al niats morro wotituwe etaliye, mank'owere baarna'a iku máátso bíamal morro bi ats wotituwe etaliye, wotowa ére de'eyiru ashuwotsi datsanatsi beyi kic'o ayide boon daatsituwe, ttewunonuwere kic'anitse itkashitwok'owe.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Ti eshuwotso! taa itsh tietirwo hank'oyiye, dúronúwo k'awnwtsere, haniyak eshe mááts detstswots mááts deshawok'o wotaarr beewne. Mááts detstswots deshawok'o wotarr beewne. <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>Shiyanirwonwere shiyaanerawwotsk'o, geneeúwirwots geneeúwerawwotskok'o wotde'er beewunee, k'ac' keewirwots, k'ac' iko deshawwotsk'ok'o woshde'er boatso taawunee. <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>Datsanatsi gaalon kis' keshiru jamwots bín kis' keyawok'o wotde'er beewunee, andi be'eyiru datsan beshitke.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Mansh konnari hasabiyon it kic'eraawon it beyo shunfee, mááts de'awu asho doonzo b́geneeúshit keewo b́geyiruwotse bíasabiyo b́ t'iwintsit doonzosh s'iilit finatse. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Mááts dek'ts asho bíasabiruwo datsan keewonat b́máátsú bín b́geneeúshit keewe. <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>Manatse tuutson bíasabiyo gitok kaywutsere etee. Mank'o mááts amaaw máátsu wee baarnaú bmeetsonat bshayiron S'ayinr doonzok woto bgeyituwotse bi asaabiyo b́t'iwintsit doonzo s'ilits finatse, mááts amts máátsunmó bkenihi máác'o k'eezosh bgeyiruwotse bgawir datsatsi keewe.<verse eid="1CO 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Taa han itsh tietiru kamboots kindr it kic'ituwok'owa etaatniyaliye itsh b́ sheengetuwok'owa etaatniye, t tewunonuwere it niwon beyarr it asaabiyo b́ bad'erawo nibi s'eenon doonzosh itfinituwok'owe.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Ik asho b́ wid'tsu dek' k'azosh b́ k'ut'iyakon mank'o b́ k'alo na'a mansh sheeng wot b́ k'azok'o bísh b́shiyeyal, maniyere okoon bin dek'o b́ geyiyal, b́ deek'onu ar bísh bíariyal b́ tewuntsok'on b́ dek'al morro woteratse, eshe dee'ewune. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Ernmó ik asho b́ nibo b́ kúp'iyal, b́ dek'etuwok'o bín woshit keewo aali wotiyal, b́ tewuno kordeketuwe wotiyal, b́ wid'tsu dek' k'azosh b́ k'ut'iyal sheenge b́ k'ali. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Eshe mááts dek'etuwo sheenge b́k'ali, mááts de'awonmó bogshdek't sheenge b́ k'ali.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Máátsu b kenihi kashon b́ befetsosh de'eyi nemon tipekiye, b kenihi b́ k'iriyalomó b shúntsosh amoosh falfane, bi amet asho amants woto geyife.<verse eid="1CO 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>T s'ilok'onomó máátso amaniyere biyal b beyink'e k'anefe, geene'arniye b beeti, taa Ik' shayiro t detstsok'o arefee.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Woteraw Ik'osh shukeets meetsi jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Woteraw ik'osh shukeets meetsi janga wotiyalo arikee «No jametswor dano detsfone» b́woteferor dano ashe bogtane etee b́dofoni, shunonmó age bíagfoni. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>«Dano detsfe» ett gawiru asho fa'ewotiyal bísh dan geyiitowok'o andoor danafa'ee. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Ik' shunts ashonmó Ik'oke daneke b́wotiti.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Mansh woteraw ik'osh shukeets meetso meyi jango b́wotiyalo, woteraw Ik'o kasho deshaw b́wottsosh Ik' ikoniyere okoniye k'osho Izar Izewer bíaalok'owo danfone. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Dab Izar Izeweri b́woterawo Izar izewerotsi ett s'eegeyirwots ayuwots Izar izewerotsnat ay doonzuwots daronat datsatse fa'ane eteyalor, <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>Noko Izar Izewermó jam keewo aztsonat noowere bíko no wottsuwots Ik'o niho b́s'uziye, mank'owere jamkeewo bín azetsonat noowere bín nobeyirwo Doonz iko Iyesus Krstos s'uziye.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Ernmó han dan jametswotsiyaliye, ik ikuwots han b́borfetsosh woteraw Ik'o ik'iyo bo doyo wosh bodek'tsotse meestso bomeyir woteraw ik'osh shuketsok'o woshdek'tniye, mansh bo asaabiyo maawk b́wottsosh bokiimiri. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>B́wotiyalor Ik'ok noon t'intsituwo mooniyaliye, moonok'azalor noosh shapit keewo aaliye, nomaalor noosh oot'et keew aaliye.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Wotowa ére nas' it keshtsan imnetiyon kup'eraw ashuwotssh t'ug b́ woterawok'o it atso korde'ere. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>«Dano detsfe» err woshosh shúketso wosh shukeyiruwoke nmaafere b́ imnetiyon kúp'eraw asho neen b́ bek'al n fintsan ashman woshosh shuketso b́ meetuwok'o bíango n kúp'iri etosha? <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Eshe nee «Dank taane» err Krstos bísh b́ k'irtsonat b́ imnetiyon kúp'eraw krstyaniyo t'afituwe etee. <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Hank'on amants it eshuwotsi dadar bo nib maawtso gaawiyon Krstosi it dadiri. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Eshe misho t eshu amantsosh t'ug b́ wotitka wotiyal t eshush t'ug wot k'azosh b́ jamon meetso maaratse.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Wosheetswots mebtiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Taa nas' keshk taanosha? Taa wosheets taanalneya? Taa doonzo Iyesusi be'atsta? Itwere doonzon t fini oot' itnalneya? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Doonzon wosheets t wottsok'o kitsit mahatabo it itwottsotse k'oshuwotssh dab wosheets woto tk'azal itshere arikon wosh na'a taane.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>«Wosheets woti mebtiyo deshatsne» err keewituwotssh ti aanitwo haniye, <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>No mishonat úshon daatsi mebtiyo deshatsnowa? <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>K'osh wosheetskok'o doonzon eshúwotsk'o P'et'rosotsk'o krstiyani máátsu de'e gúrosh mebtiyo deshatsnowa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Wee finar beyo b́ geyit taanat Barnabas s'uzsheya? <verse eid="1CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Demozalo b́ took gizon kes'fo kone? Woyiniyo tohr b́ shuwo maarawo kone? Gizi s'eeno jinr bíezo úyawo kone?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Han t keewir ash asaabiyok'oneya? Nemonu hank'o eratsa? <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Iwi. 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 T'im. 5:18</ref> </char></note> «Mááy sirbiru minz beero b́ noono tipk'aye» ett nemotse guut'ere, eshe Ik'o hank'o bíet minz beruwotssh shiyanatneya? <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Ik'o han bíet noosh shiyanatniyosha? Gosh goshiruwo jángát b́ goshiruwok'o, mááy bútsirwo jángát b́ bútsiruwotse, hank'on jamo b́ bano b́ daatsituwok'o, han arikon b́ guut'e no jangoshe. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 15:27">Rom 15:27</ref> </char></note> Noo shayiri keewo itsh no shookori wotiyal it meets deero itoke no k'es'al een keeweya b́ wotiti? <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>K'oshwots keewan itoke daatso boosh geyife wotiyal eshe no haniyere bogo daatso aawuk'oneya noosh geyiyo b́ k'azeti? Nooyere mebtiyann t'ak'ameratsone, no Krstosko doo shishiyosh t'ug b́woterawok'o jam keewo k'ama nok'amri bako mebtiyan t'ak'ameratsone. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 18:1">Iwi. 18:1</ref> </char></note> Ik' mootse finiruwots bo misho Ik' mootsne bodatsituwok'o wosh t'inetseyiru t'arap'ezoke finirwitsu wosh manatse kayide'er bometwok'o danatsteya? <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat. 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk'. 10:7</ref> </char></note> Mank'o doo shishiyo daniruwotsu bometuwo fin manatse bo daatsituwok'o Ik'o azazere.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Taamó mebtiyanotsitsere ikunoru t'ak'ameratse, hanowre t guut' t mebtiyan eegishe taash koteyo b́ k'azi? Etaatniyaliye, asho bín t ít'iruwo datsmec'ron b́ oriyoniyere k'iro taash k'anefe. <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Doo shishiyo daniyo taash geyik b́ wottsotse t it'et keewo aaliye dab doo shishiyan daniyo tk'azal indowe taana! <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Doo shishi keew angnon b́ woterawo t shunon tdaniruwosh k'awutso detsfe, angnona t finiri wotiyalomó taash imetsmani ti fini bako k'osh tk'alts keewo fa'ee etaliye. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Eshe t maawirwosh t k'awuntso eebi? T maawi k'awntso doo shishwo daniyir daats taash geyituwo t de'aawo doo shishi fino damozalo hank'on t finoniye.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Taa konshor guuts twoterawo nas' ash taane, wotowa ére t faltsok'on aywotsi kashiyir boon t'akamosha etaat jamosh guutso wotere. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Ayhudiyotston t wotor ayhudiyotsi kashiyosh ayhudiyotsk'o twoti, taa nemi shirots woto t k'azalor dab́ nemi shirotstsuwotsi kashiyosha etaat nemi shirotse beyiru ashuwotsk'o t woti. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Taa Ik' nemo detstsonat Krstos nemi shirots t wotiyaloru dab́ nem deshaw Ik' ash woterawotsi kashiyosha etaat nem deshaw ashok'o twoti. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Bo imnetiyon maawtswotsi kashiyosha etaat maawtswotskok'o maawk t woti, t faltsok'on muk'uwotsi kashiyosh jamonton jam keewo t woti.<verse eid="1CO 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Jaman t k'alir dooshishiko deero kayosh dooshiyosha etaatniye. <verse eid="1CO 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Wos'i nokorewor jametso b́wos'fook'o boyitsnowere ik s'uzo shlmatiyo b́dek'fook'o danatsteya? Mansh itwoor shlmatiyo dek'osh woc'ere. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Wos'on noheyiru jamwots maawfetsr anaanshr dano woshfne, bo mank'o bomaawir beshituwo t'afitwonat andish wotitu akliliyo daatsoshe, noomó nomaawir t'afraawonat dúre dúrik wotts akliliyo daatsoshe. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Taamó am b́ bodooko danawu ashokok'o datsmec'ro woc'atse, jongo kisho t'umde'er jot'iruwok'o datsmec'ro shóótetk taanaliye. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Mansh k'oshuwotsi nohewo maants s'eetk'riyakon taa t tookon nohemanitse úr wotaarr tdaatserawok'o tiatso korde'er taash bíazazetuwok'o woshituwe.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Woteraw ik'uwotsi ik'iyo b́geyirawok'owo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Kesh. 13:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:22-29">14:22-29</ref> </char>
    </note> Tieshuwotso! Nonihots daawno bo abaatse wotdek't boon b́ jishfere b́teshok'o jametswots aatsk'ar biro bokimtsok'o itsh gawiyo geefe. <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Musenton ikwotoshat daawnanat aats k'aranits bogupeyi. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Kesh. 16:35</ref> </char></note> Únetswotsu ik naari shayiri mishman máárne, bo únetswere Shayiri úshman úshrnee, <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 17:6">Kesh. 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 25:1-18">Taaw. 25:1-18</ref> </char></note> Únetswotswor iknaari shayiri úshe boúshi, bo úshtsonwere boon shoyidek't sha'efetst teshts shayiri s'almanitse t'úúp'ke b́tesh, s'almanuwere b́tookon Krstosiye b́teshi. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Taaw. 14:29-30</ref> </char></note> Man b́woteferor ayuwotsn Ik'o genee'úweratse, mansh bo duuno woruwots juweyat b́oori. <verse eid="1CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 11:14">Taaw. 11:14</ref> </char></note> Bo gond keewo botewntsok'o noowere gond keewo notewunrawok'o jaman noosh ats kotiyosh ariyetso wotere. <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Kesh. 32:6</ref> </char></note> «Ashuwots móónat úshosh beebodek'i, weeralonowere duubosh botuwi» ett bo jangosh guut'etsok'on, bo woteraw Ik'o bo ik'itsok'o it were bokok'o woteraw ik'uwotsi Ik'i k'ayere. <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-18">Taaw. 25:1-18</ref> </char></note> Boyitsere ik ikuwots widi morro bofintsok'o noowere widi morro finonowa? Bo han bok'altsotse boyitse hiye keez kum ashuwots ik aawon k'irrne. <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 21:5-6">Taaw. 21:5-6</ref> </char></note> Boyitsi ik ikuwots fadt dawunzoon shaas'eyat bok'irtsok'o noowere Krstosi fadk'ayone. <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>Boyitse ik ikuwots mumundat úd'iru melakiyon bot'aftsok'o itwere mumund k'ayere.<verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Keew jaman boats b́bod noosh no ats kotiyosh ariyeyi, guut'ewwere dúri s'uwaatse fa'úwotssh noosh dano b́wotishe. <verse eid="1CO 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Eshe need'iruwok'o ariru asho b́ dihrawok'o bí atso korde'e. <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Ashaats bodiru fadewoniyere k'osh fadewo itats boratse, Ik'o amaneke, it angoniyere bog wotts fadewo it ats b́ bodetuwok'o eekeratse, it fadeworo bín it k'amit ango imr fademanitse it keshet weero itsh k'anitwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Mansh eshe shuneetswotso! woteraw ik'uwotsi ik'iyatse wokoore. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Hanowre itsh t'iwintsirwotsi itwottsotsne, hansh taa tkeewirwo it itokon aab angshuwere. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Mat. 26:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-24">Mar. 14:22-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:19-20">Luk'. 22:19-20</ref> </char></note> Noo Ik'o udat nokayirwo deerets úshi wanc'o Krstos s'atsonton ik woto detsfoshna? Notitsiru mishonwere Krstos meetsenton ik woto detsfoshna? <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Meeyiru mishman ik b́wottsotse noowere ikánatse kayiruwotsi nowottsotse aywotsi nowotiyalor ik ats noone.<verse eid="1CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 7:6">Lew. 7:6</ref> </char>
    </note> Aab Israe'el ashaashwots bok'altso s'iilere, tiiniru wosho meyiruwots wosht'intseyiru t'arap'ezonton ikwoto deshatsnowa boteshi? <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Eshe hank'o t etor woshosh t'intsets meetso wotk keewa eteya tieti? Himó woteraw Ik'o wotk keewa etya tieti? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:17">Iwi. 32:17</ref> </char></note> Mank'owiyaliye! Ik' ash woterawwots wosho bot'ntsir Ik'osh b́ woterawo fo'erawwotsshe, eshe it fo'erawwotsnton ik woto itdetsetuwok'o geeratse, <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Doonzo úshi wanc'o úyifetsr aani fo'erawwots úshi wanc'o úsho falatste, doonzo mishi marats kayefetsr fo'erawwots mishi maratse kayiruwotsi woto falatste, <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Iwi. 32:21</ref> </char></note> Eshe hank'o k'alr doonzo okoriwonowa? No bíyere bogo kúp'efnwa?<verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:12">1 K'or. 6:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Jam keewo baziyekaliye, ernmó jam keewo t'ak'amitkaliye, jam keewo baziyekaliye, ernmó jam keewo agetkaliye. <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Asho ik ikon k'oshuwotssh b́ sheengetwok'owa bako b́ took t'k'miyo geek'aye.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>It nibots tuwiru amank'azo okjuk'rar gawuyatse kemeyiru meetso eega eega iterawon moore. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Dub. 24:1</ref> </char></note> «Datsunat biitse fa'a jamo Doonzoke.»<verse eid="1CO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Krstiyani woteraw asho iti móósh b́s'eegal móósh iti b́s'eegtsmanok itametka wotiyal itsh t'inetu mish jamo it tookotse tuwit amank'azjamo okjuk'rar eega eega iterawon moore. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Ernmó ash iko «Meetsan woteraw ik'osh shukeeke» bíetal ash man han b́ keewtsonat nibo b́dantsotse meetsman maak'ayere. <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>Niba ti etorowere asho niboni eta bako it niboniyaliye tietiriye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Bére s'ayin twoto k'osh ash nibats bíangshiir eegoshe? <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Taa Ik'o údefetśr tmáal Ik'o bín túdiru keewatse tuutson eegoshe taan k'ooreti?<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Eshe it moor wotowa it úshor wotowa jamkeewo it k'alor jamkeewo Ik' mangosh k'alwere. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Ayhudiwotsi wotowá, Ik' ash woterawwotsi wotowá, Ik'i moonor b́wotiyal, kon shoor t'ug wotk'ayere. <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>Taa jametsuwots bokashituwok'o jametswotssh b́shengisha bako ttookosh b́sheengetuwok'o tgeerawotse, ash jamo tk'aliru k'alon tgene'úshiruwok'o itwoor mank'o k'aluwere.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:16">1 K'or. 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Filp. 3:17</ref> </char>
    </note> Taa Krstosi tiartsok'o itwere taan arore.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik' Ik'iyi niwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Jam aawo taan it gawirwonat itsh t imts dano kúp'idek'at dets itdek'tsotse, itn údiruwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Ernmó nungush jami tooko Krstosi, mááts tooko nungusho, Krstos tokonwere Ik'o niho b́wottsok'o it danetwok'o shunfee. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Tooko p'urdek't Ik' k'oniruwo wee bek'i aap'o keewiru nungush jamo b́ tookoniye b́ketiyiri. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Mank'owere btooko p'ur bde'awon Ik' k'oniru wee bek'i aap'o keewiru máátsu b tookoniye bketiri, btooko p'ureraw máátsu bs'ageetsok'owe b́taaweti. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Máátsu b tooko p'ureratsane wotiyal b took s'iiro k'ut'ewiye, ernmó btook s'iiro k'ut'ewo wee s'ageyo bin ketit keewa wotiyal b tooko p'urowiye. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:26-27">Aze. 1:26-27</ref> </char></note> Nungusho Ik'o ariyetsonat Ik' mango bín b́ be'etk b́ wottsotse b́ tooko p'uro geyiratse, máátsunmó nungushi mangiye. <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Máátsuni nungushatse daatseyi bako nungusho máátsatse daatseratse. <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8-9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:18-23">Aze. 2:18-23</ref> </char></note> Mank'were máátsu nungushosha bi azeeyi bako nungusho máátsush azeratse <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Hanatse tutsonat melakiwots shinatse alishirootse b́fa'ok'o kitsitwo, p'uro b tookats gerde'iye. <verse eid="1CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Doonzoke no detsts beyon máátsu nungushalo beratsane, nungushonu máátsalo beeratse. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Máátsu nungushatse b datetsok'o nungushonu b́ shuwet máátsatsne, ernmó nungusha wotowa mááts wotowa k'osh jamkeewonu Ik'okne b́ daatseti.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>Aab it tookon anghsuwere, máátsu btooko b p'urerawo Ik'o k'ono bish wotituwa? <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Nungusho b́ took s'iiro b́genziyal bísh keeti mit b́ wotok'o hank'on azeyon danekosha? <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>Máátsunmó bish took s'iiro ime btooko bín ipbdek'etuwok'o b́wottsotse btook s'iiro bgeenziyal bish bmangee. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Han jangatse moosh geyiru asho fa'ewotiyal noon wotowa Ik'i maa k'oshuwots wotowa hank'o doyo deshatsone.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doonzo kooc'i mishi jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mat. 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mar. 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk'. 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>It ko'ewor it k'aliruwo gonda bako sheeng keew b́woterawotse and itsh ti imiru dananatse iti úderatse. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Jamoniyere shino ikwotdek'at it kakuwewor it dagotse k'osh k'oshewo b́beyo shishre, t shishts keewonwere badooko arik b́wottsok'o amaniruwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Ar keewetsuwots konotsi bowottsok'o galeyar bodanetwok'o ititse k'osh k'oshewo b́beyo jinatse. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Ikok it kakuwewor it meeyir doonzo kooc'i mishaliye. <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>It móór iko iko b́ korááwo bíyaailye b́meyiri, mank'oon iko b́ k'ak'efere iko mashe b́mashiri. <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Eshe it meetuwoknat it úshet moo deshatsteya? Himó Ik' moone it gac'iri? Himó eegoru bo meetu deshawwotsne it jiitsiri? Eshe eege itsh tieteti? Keewansh iten údota? B́ jamon úderatse!<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Doonzoke t dek'tsonat itsh tbeshits dano haniye, doonzo besheyat b́ imewots t'ú manots misho k'aúb́dek'i, <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>Ik'o b́ údiyakon tiitsdek't, «[nahere móóre,] han itsh wotituwo tiaatsoniye, han taan bín itgawitwo wosh de'ere» bíeti <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Kesh. 24:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Erm. 31:31-34</ref> </char></note> Mank'o kooc' mishoniyre il úshi wanc'o k'aaúdek't «Úshi wanc'an t s'atson finet handr taaroniye, jam aawo han itúshor bín taan gawosh wosh de'ere» bí eti.<verse eid="1CO 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Mishan itmooronat úshi wanc'an it úshor jam aawo doonzo b́ wafetsosh b́ k'iro keewitute. <verse eid="1CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Konuworu asho bísh wot geyirawo doonzo tusho b́ móónat doonzo úshi wanc'an b́ úshal doonzo atsonat s'atso k'awunts bí ats wotituwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Eshe konworu asho tushan b́ mooniyere shinonat wanc'an b́ úshoneyere shino b́ tooko shú s'iilo bísh geyife. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Asho konworu doonzo atso eeg b́ wotok'o galde'er b́ dananiyere doonzo tusho b́ maal doonzo úshi wanc'o b́ úshal b́ tookats angshe b́ doweti. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>It dagotsere ayuwots bomawutsonat boshodu ik ikuwotsu bok'iriye han jangatsne. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Noo notokats angshrone wotink'e no ats angsherawunk'ee b́teshi. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Ernmó il datsunton noats angsherawok'o and angshiru doonzo noon b́ seziri.<verse eid="1CO 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Eshe t eshuwotso! Doonzo kooc' mishosh it ko'eyor it ats atseyo korewere. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>It ko'ewo angshosh b́ woterawok'o ititse k'ak'ts asho b́ beyal b́ meyitse moowe. Oorts keewosh taa manok twoor dabr bín jiishetwo itsh imetuwe.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">S'ayin shayiri imuwotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Ti eshuwotso! ando S'ayin shayiro b́imet imuwotsi it dano geefe. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Ik'i ash woterawwotsi it teshor it danaw keewwotsn jisheyat noon keew falraw woteraw ik'uwots maants iti daamefok'o danfte. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Mansh Ik'i shayiron jisheyar Iyesusi c'ashetuwo konwor aaliye, mank'owere S'ayin shayiron jisheyarni bako «Iyesus doonze!» etetuwo konworu bí aalok'o itsh keewituwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>K'osh k'osh S'ayin shayiri imuwots fa'ane, S'ayin shayironmó ike. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>K'osh k'osh finuwots fa'ane, doonzonmó ike. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>K'osh k'osh fini naaruwots fa'ane, ernmó jamo b́jamon finituwo ik Ik'oniye. <verse eid="1CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>No ik iketsitse S'ayin shayiro be'eyat b́ fiinirye jametsi t'k'miyoshe. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>S'ayin shayiro ik ashosh dani teleefi aap'o imetuwe, k'osh ashoshowere shayirman dani aap'o bí imeti, <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Ik shayirman ikosh imnetiyo bí imeti, k'oshoshmó shodets kashiyit imo bí imeti, <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Ikosho Ik'oke bek'on keewo, ikoshowere Shayirwotsi galde dano, ikosho k'osh naari noon keewo, k'oshoshowere imets k'osh noonon keewtso bits falo bí imeti, <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4-11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 12:6-8">Rom 12:6-8</ref> </char></note> Wotowa'ere jamán k'alituwo ik shayirmaniye, S'ayin shayiro b́ shunok'o ik ik ashosh k'osh k'osh imo b́ imeti.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik ash atsatse k'osh k'osh atsi kaywots bobeyok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:4-5">Rom 12:4-5</ref> </char>
    </note> Ash iko ayi atsi kayuwotsi detsfe, bí atsi kaywots ayi bowotefere bobeyir ik ash manatse. Hank'o Krstos ayi atsi kaywotsi detsts ik atsi kayok'owiye. <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Ayhudi nowotiyalo Grik ash nowotiyalo, guutswotsi nowotiyalo, S'ayinwotsi nowotiyalor, ik ats wotosh ik shayiri S'ayinon guuperoone, noúnetswor shayir ikanitse úshrone.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Ik atso b́fiine ay atsi kaywotsatsna bako ik atsi kayo s'uzatsnaliye! <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Tufo «Taa kish woto tk'aztsotse atsi kay taanaliye!» bíetal eshe hank'o bíettsosh atsi kay b́woto oorituwa? <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Waazonuwere «Taa ááw woto tk'aztsotse atsi kay taanaliye» bíetal, eshe, hank'o bíettsosh atsi kay b́woto oorituwa? <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Ats iko b́ jamon ááw b́wotink'ere eegneya shisho b́faliyank'oni? Ats iko b́ jamon waaz b́ wotink'ere eegneya shink'o b́faliti? <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Andmó Ik'o b́ shunok'o ik ik atsi kayo atsotse bísh wotit beyokok b́beyoko deshde'er b́datseetuwok'o woshre. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Boúnetswor ik kayo s'uzi bowotink'ere ats jamo eewkneya b́ datseeyank'oni? <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Andomó ay atsi kaywots bobeyalor atso ik s'uzee.<verse eid="1CO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Aawo kishosh «Nee taash geyiratsne!» etosh falratse, tookonuwere tufosh «Nee taash geyiratsne!» etosh falratse, <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Dab́nuwor bítsi maawkwotsi araat be'eyiru atsi kaywots iki bogshdek't geyiknee. <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>Mangi muk' detstswotsi araat noosh be'eyiru atsi kayuwots iki bog mango boosh imetuwone, bek'osh jitsik araat noosh be'eyiru atsi kaywotssh iki bog mango imaat boon nokotiriye, <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>Bek'osh sheengiru atsi kaywotsmó jaman boosh geyiratse, Ik'onmó s'ilosh jitsitu araat be'eyiru atsi kayuwotssh bog mango bo detsetwok'o woshdek'́t atsi kayuwotsi gonkire. <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>Hanowere b́k'al atsi kaywots dagotse k'osh k'osheyalo bo ats atseyo bogawetuwok'owe. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Ik atsi kayo b́ kic'iyal k'osh atsi kaywotsuwere jamon bíntoniye bo kic'iti, ik atsi kayonu mango b́ daatsor k'osh atsi kaywotswere bínton ikn bo geneúwiti.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>It Krstos atsi kayi itne, it ik ikon bíatsi kay itne. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 4:11">Efe. 4:11</ref> </char></note> Mansh Ik'o ik ik asho Ik' mootse k'osh k'osh fino bodetsetuwok'o woshre, hank'on shino woshetswotsi, gitlo nebiyatiyotsi, kezlon danirwotsi naashire. Dabtnuwere adits finituwotsi, dabt shodtso kashiyo boosh imetswotsi, ashuwotsi t'ep'o boosh imetswotsi, jiishiruwotsnat k'osh k'osh noonon keewiru ashuwotsi woshre. <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Jamwots wosheetswtsneya? Jamwots nebiyatiyotsneya? Jamwots danirwotsneya? Jamwots adits finirwotsneya? <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Jamwots shodts kashiyo boosh imeknowa? Jamwots handr noonon keewo falfnowa? Jamwots handr noonon keewetso biitso falfnowa? <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Eshe ayidek't bogf imo daatsosh gewoore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Dab and jamoniyere bog weerindo itsh kitsuna.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Ari shuno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Taa ashuwots noon keewon wee melakiwots handr noonon keewo falr shuno deshatse wotiyal kuhiru biri wee cicilru bilbilyo twotoniye. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat. 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:21">21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mar. 11:23</ref> </char></note> Bek'on keewi imo tdetsalor aashts jamo tdanalor, danjamo tdetsalor, guro beyokere k'osh beyok beshit imnetiyi jamo t detsal shuno deshatse wotiyal taash eegor k'aatse. <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>T detsts jamo t'owwotssh t kayiyal, dab tiatso b́ ooriraniyere bín it'osha err,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="ft">Branitsi ik ik mas'afotse «It'osha» etfne. </char></note> beshide'er ti imal, shuno t t'ut'al eegoru taash k'alatse.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Shuno k'ame b́ k'amefoni, shuno sheenge b́ k'alfoni, shuno okoorrake, shuno bog taana erake, shuno id'ake, <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>Shuno niwalo finerake, shuno b́ took jang mec'ro geerake, shuno nibo k'unake, shuno bín dadeyaloru dadman dadok'o taawakee, <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>Shuno ar wotts keewatsa b́ geneúiti bako kááw woterawonton geneúwerakee, <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Shuno jamo falituwe, jamono amanituwe, b́ jangituwere jamoniye, jam keewon kúp'e b́wotiti.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Shuno b́ jamon dihiratse, bek'on keewo imets imo beshituwe handr noonon keew falo beshituwe, dan wotiyalowere beshituwe. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>No danon wotowa bek'on no keewitwo k'atsoniye. <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>Ernmó s'een wottso b́woor k'atso ooritke.<verse eid="1CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Na'a t wotor na'ok'owa t keewufo, na'ok'owa t gawfo, nana'ok'owa t maramarefni, gan asho t wotoromó nana'i doy jamo k'aztk'iri. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>And mestawut shuwa shuwa etir mastawit gondotse s'ilirwotskok'o noone, bíyormó shin shinaatsne nobek'eti, and tdanir k'atsoniye, bíyoromó Ik'o taan b́ dantsok'osh s'een dano detsetwe.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Eshe imnetiyo, jángo, shuno, keezanots oorar betknee, ernmó hanotsitsere bogetuwo shune.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s">Andr noonon keewo imetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Eshe shuno daatsosh gewoore, S'ayin shayiri imuwotsitse dab bitsnor bek'on keewo kup'arr gewoore. <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Andr noonon noon keewitwo Ik'osha bako ashoshaliye b́keewiri, ááshk wotts keewo S'ayin shayiri angon b́ keewirwosh b́ keewirman danetuwo aaliye. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Bek'on keewitwonmó k'osho agosh, kup'iyonat atskup'iyosha ashuwotssh keewituwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Andr noon keewon keewit asho b́ took mec'roniye bíagiriye, bek'on keewirwonmó Ik' moo agetwe.<verse eid="1CO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>No jamets andr noon keewon it keewo shunfee b́ teshi, bogshde'er t shunetuwonmó bek'on it keewink'ere, Ik' maa ashuwotsi agosh andr noon keewon keewetso biitsetuwo bí alitka wotiyal, andr noon keewiru ashoniyere bek'on keewiru asho bogfe. <verse eid="1CO 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Eshe t eshuwotso! itok twoor andr noonon keewon keewufere t weyi wotink'ere eebi itsh t k'aliyank'oni? Bogo itsh t k'alitiye Ik'oke ááshtso kitson wee danon wee bek'on keewon wee dano itsh deshde'er twaale.<verse eid="1CO 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Turarok'onat T'imbok'o kash deshaw duubi k'ac'uwots k'osh jááwi k'ááro bo t'ut'al bo imiru duubi k'ááro awuk'o b́ wotok'o aawuk'oneya b́ daneti? <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Ezbedo daneraw k'ááron b́ fugeyal, kes'osh kone k'aniti? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Mank'owere it be'ets andr noonon keewetsman it keewor it dants noon keewon keewo it k'azal it keewirwo kone danosh faliti? Jongosh keewirwok'owe it wotiti. <verse eid="1CO 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Datsanatsere ay naari noon keewwots fa'ane bits deshaw noon keewo aaliye. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Taash keeweyiru noon keewi biitso danatse wotiyal keewiru ash mansh ibee t wotiti, bíwere taash ibee b́ wotiti. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>It S'ayin shayiri imuwotsi kup'shdek'at it geyiruwosh, bogshde'er geyo itn b́geyiyit Ik' maa ashuwots bín bokup'it imuwots boayituwok'owe.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Andr noon keewiru asho b́ keewirwo biitso b́ falituwok'o Ik'o k'onuwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Andr noon keewon Ik'o t k'oniyal t shayirona Ik'o tk'oniri bako t níbo shuwalke b́ wotiti. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Bére eeg t k'ale taan b́ geyiyiti? T shayiron Ik'o k'onituwe, t nibon dab Ik'o k'onituwe, t shayirono Ik'osh dúbetuwe, t nibon Ik'osh dúbetuwe <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Hank'o woto b́ k'azal nee shayiron Ik'o n údor, nee ni etiruwo danawu asho n údonat ni Ik' k'onosh «Amen» eto aawuk'oneya b́ faliti? <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Arikon nee nt'iintstso údon Ik'o k'ono sheengetskee, ernmó ash k'osho bín kup'eratse.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Taa it úneetsiyere bogo handr noonon keewirwo twottsosh Ik'o údirwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Ernmó k'oshuwotsi daniyosha err Ik' mootse tats kum aap'uwotsi handr noonon keewoniye úts aap'uwotsi ttookon keewo shunfee.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>T eshuwwotso! gond keewosh nana'i marmat'ok'o wotoore bako it asaabiyon nan'i marmat'uwotskok'o wotk'ayere, maniyere it asaabiyon katstswotsi wotoore. <verse eid="1CO 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:11-12">Isa. 28:11-12</ref> </char></note> Manuwere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">«Handr noonon keewiru ashuwotsnat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">Bo noon keew keewo daneraw ashuwots noonon ash ashaanotssh keewitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">Mank'o b́wotiyalor taan k'ewatsne etfe Doonzo Ik'oni»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 14:21">ett nemoots guut'ere.<verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Hansh andr noon keew keewon keewo milikit b́wotit amaneraw ashuwotssh bako amaniru ashuwotsshaliye, bek'on keewets keewo keewonmó milikit b́wotit amaniru ashuwotssha bako amaneraw ashuwotsshaliye.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Krstiyaniwots bokakuwewor Ik' maa ashuwots andr noon keew keewon b́ keewor danawwots wee amaneraw ashuwots bowaal keewirwotssh «Ashaanots geeniya bowutsi» etaalknowa? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Ernmó ik iko bek'on bo keewiyal amanerawo wee danaw asho b́waal b́shishts keew jamon bísh shiyeetuwe, wee jamon bíyats angshituwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>B́ nibots ááshts keewo keer be'etuwe, b́ baronowere gup' gup'dek't «Arikon Ik'o itdagootse!» eton Ik'osh b́sagaditi.<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik wotdek't Ik'o k'oneewor beyosh bín geyit niwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Eshuwwotso! eshe eeg k'alo geyifa? Ik' k'onosh it kakuwewor ititse iko Ik'osh duubo detsfe, k'oshonu daniyo detsfe, k'oshonu ááshts keewo kish kitso detsfe, iko ando andr noonon keewo detsfe, ikonu keewetsman biitso detsfe. Eshe, jaman krstiyaniwotsi agetk woto bíngeyife. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Andr noon keewwotsi keewirwots bobeyal git bor wee bí ayiyal keez wotde'er keewne, bo bokeewirwono k'osh asho biishe. <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Keewetsman biitsiru asho bíaalitka wotiyalmó andr noonon keewirwo kakweetsmanotsitse s'k eree, b́tookonat Ik'osh keewwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Bek'on keewitu gito wee keez wotar keewitunee, k'oshuwotsmó keewetsman k'ewude t'iwintsde s'iilne. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Ko'eyat beyirwotsitse k'osh asho ik jago b́ bek'al, shini keewiru man s'k err beewe. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Ik ikuwots bo danetuwok'onat bo kup'ituwok'o it jamets taron Ik' wosho keewo falfte. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Nebiyiwots bek'i shayiro nebiyiyotssh keewetuwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>Jeeni Ik'o Izar Izeweri bako fayi Ik'o Izar Izeweriyaliye. S'ayin Ik'i maa ash jamotse k'alefok'o, <verse eid="1CO 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>máátswots Ik' maa ashuwotsitse s'k erne. Nemonmó bí etir bo boaletwok'owa bako bo alititwok'o eekeratse. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Ik ik keewo danosh bo geyiyal bo kenih keniho bo meyitse aatune, Ik' k'onosh ko'eyor máátsuwots bo keewo jiitsike.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Beree Ik' aap'o b́ waa itokneya? Himó Ik' aap'o b́ waa itok mec'ree? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>«Taa nebiyi taane wee taa Shayiron imetso detsfe» eteet asho b́ beyal t guut'tsan doonzo tzaziyo b́ wotok'o dande'e. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Han danawo b́ beyal bíwere danek'aye.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Eshe t eshuwotso! bek'on keewosh kup'ar gewoore, andr noon keewono bazik'ayere. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Ernmó jam keewo niwonat matson wotowe.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s">Krstos k'irotse b́tuutsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Eshe ando t eshuwotso! itsh tdanits doo shishi aap'o itsh gawiwo geefe, doo shishy aap'onwere it dek'tsonat kup'dek'at bíyats it needirwoniye. <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Taa itsh tdaniitso doo shishi aap'o kup'ide'er desh it dek'ink'ere bín kashiyank'te, maniyere okoonmó it amantso datsmec'roone.<verse eid="1CO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Taa t dek'ts shintso jamoniyere bogo itsh beshire, itsh tbeshits keewonwere S'ayin mas'aafotse guut'etsok'on Krstos no morrosh k'irre, <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>duukere, S'ayin mas'aafotse guut'etsok'onowere keezl aawots k'irotse tuure etke. <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>Bí P'et'rossh be'ere, ilowere tatse git woshetswotssh be'ere, <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Úts bal ashuwotsiyere bogts b́shuuts shoydek't sha'iruwotssh iknoto be'ere, boyitse ayuwots andish b́borfetsosh fa'ane, ik ikuwotsmó k'irrne. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Maniye hakonowere Yak'obsh be'ere, wosheets jamwotssho be'ere.<verse eid="1CO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Jami s'uwaatsnowere shabetsok'o wottsosh taash ando be'ere. <verse eid="1CO 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Taa Ik'i moo gishtso twottsotse wosheets jamwotsitse dashonat wosheka err s'eegeyo taash geyirawo taane. <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Ernmó taa and twottso wotat tdaatseyir Ik'i s'aatonee, taashowere imets s'aato shuwalon ooreratse, dabnuwor k'oshuwotsiyere bogo finon mawure, erenmó han k'alirwo taanton fa'a Ik'i s'aatoni bako taanaliye. <verse eid="1CO 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Eshe taan wotowa boon wotowa nodaniyrwo haniye, itwere itamantso haniye.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ashuwots k'irotse tuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Krstos k'irotse b́ tuutsk'owa no daniyiri wotiyalmó ititsere ik ikuwots aawk'oneya k'irots tuwo aaliye boetiri? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>K'irotse tuwo aali wotiyal Krstos k'irotse tuuratse etee, <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>Krstos k'irotse tuuratse wotiyal no daniruwoni wotowa it imnetiyo k'awuntso deshatse etee, <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Ik'o Krstosi k'irotse tizre etaat daniruwots kootets Ik'i gawwotsi woterone etee, eshe k'irts ashuwots k'irotse tuwatsno wotiyal Ik'o Krstosi k'irotse tuzatse etee. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>K'irts ashuwots k'irotse tuwatsno wotiyal Krstos k'irotse tuwatse etee. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Krstos k'irotse tuuratse wotiyal it imnetiyo k'awuntso deshatse etee, andoru morrotsa it beyiri etee, <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Krstosn amanat k'irtswots t'afrnee etee, <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Krstosi nojangir datsanatsi be mec'rosha wotiyal ash jamoniyere bogo noosh shiyanetk nowotoniye.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Ernmó Krstos k'irtswotssh k'irotse tuwon k'aabo wotat arikon k'irotse tuure. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>K'iro b́ waa ik asho atse tuutson b́ wottsok'o k'irotse tuwonu b́ weet ik asho atse tuutsone. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Adam atse tuutson ash jamo b́k'iriruowok'o mank'o Krstos atse tuutson ash jamo kasho daatsituwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Man b́wotituwere ik ikosh b́ tar tarone, Krstos k'irotse tuwooke shintsoniye, ilowere Krstos b́woor bík wottsuwots k'irotse tuwitune. <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Maniyere hakowere bíalguronat alona ang jamo t'afir mengsto Ik'o Nihosh beshide b́ ímet aawo dúri s'uwoniye b́ wotiti. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Dub. 110:1</ref> </char></note> Ik'o b́ balangar jamwotsi bí ali shirots b́ woshfetsosh Krstos b́ naasho geyiyituwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Da'eyar s'uwatse t'afitu t'elato k'ironiye. <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Dub. 8:6</ref> </char></note> «Ik'o jam keewo bí ali shirots woshk'rere» ettso guut'ere, maniye daneke, ernmó «Jam keewo bí ali shirots wotere» bíetor jam keewo bí ali shirots woshts Ik'o nihono dabaatse <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Jam keewo Krstos ali shirots b́ wotiyakon Ik'o niho jámo b́jámon b́ wotituwok'o naayo b́ tookon jám keewo bí ali shirots woshtso Ik'o niho shirots wotitwe.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Eshe k'irts ashuwots tuwatsno wotiyal k'irts ashuwots jangosh guupeyiru jamwots eebi bo'ot'oni? k'irts ashuwots b́ jamon k'irotse tuuratsno wotiyal ashuwots boshegro eegosha etniya bo gupeyiri? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Noo nowotiyaloru aaw aawon t'up' er tawootse nobeyir eegoshe? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>T eshuwotso! taa aaw aawuon k'iro taan b́ datsiri, hanowere t keewir doonzo Iyesus Krstos jangosh itatse t detsts it'o arik b́wottsotsne. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Isa. 22:13</ref> </char></note> Ash asaabiyok'on taa Efesonn dini s'ootswotsnton t kaare eeg orshoshe? K'irtswots k'irotse tuuratsno wotiyal «Yaats nok'iritwotse woore moone, úyone» eteetsok'oyiye.<verse eid="1CO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Dáshek'ayere, «Woteraw tooho sheeng doyoniye bí awashifoni.» <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>It nibo maants aanoore, morro fink'ayere, ititsere ik ikuwots Ik' danawwots fa'ane. Hano ti etiri it jitsitwok'wa etaatniye.<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">K'irotse tuuts atso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Asho iko «K'irts ashuwots aawk'oneya botuwit? k'irotse bo tuwor bodetset atso awuk'one?» err aato falitwe, <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Nee dogono n shokiru mááyo b́ k'irrawo boc'r beyo falatse, <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Nee n shokor Geshi shooko wee k'osh mááyi shooko s'uzi n shooketi bako ili bos'et miti gindoniyaliye. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Ik'onmó shook mansh b́ shuntsok'o miti gindo b́ imeti, ik ik shookosh k'osh k'osh miti gindo b́ imeti.<verse eid="1CO 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Meets jamo ik naaraliye, ash meetso ik naare, gizi meetso k'osh naare, Kafuwots meetso k'osh naare, Mus' meets k'osh naare.<verse eid="1CO 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Mank'o daritsi atso fa'ee, datsatsi atsonu fa'ee, ernmó daratsi atsi mango ik naare, datsatsi atsi mangonu k'osh naare. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Aawi mango ik naare, Ashitsi mangonuwere k'osh naare, K'enuwots mangonu k'osh naare, ik k'eeno k'osh k'eenoniyere k'osh mango detsfe.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>K'irotse tuwit ashuwots jango haniye bíari, t'afitu k'irts atso wotat shooketso k'irawu beetk atso wotar tuwituwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>Ketoon shooketso mangon tuwitwe, maawon shooketso kúp'on tuwituwe, <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Meetsi ats wotat shooketso shayiri atso wotar tuwituwe. Meetsi atso b́ beyok' shayiri atsonuwere fa'ee. <verse eid="1CO 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:45 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Aze. 2:7</ref> </char></note> Mansh, «Shints asho Adam kashets azeetso b́ woti» ett guut'ere, iltso Adam Krstosmó kash imet shayiro b́ woti. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Ernmó shintso b́ waa meetsone bako shayironaliye, shayiron wottso b́waa meetson wottsoniyere ile. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Shints asho Adam bí azee shawatse b́ wottsosh datsatsike, gitl ashonmó b́waa daratsnee. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Datsats wottswots datsatse azeets ashok'one, daaratse wottsuwots daaratse waats ashok'one. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Datsatsi asho aro noartsok'o daratsi asho aronowere aritwone.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Eshuwotso! itsh tkeewirwo haniye, meetsonat s'atson Ik'i mengsto naaratse, mank'owere k'irr t'afit atso t'afrawu kashets atso naaratse.<verse eid="1CO 15:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>Eshe! mist'iri iko itsh keewirwe. Noo noúnetswor k'irratsone. Ernmó no únets wonetuwone. <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>Nowoneetwonwere s'uwatse ezbedo fugewor ááwi k'iluowok'o iknotone. Ezbedo fugetuwe, k'irts ashuwotswere t'afraw kashetswotsi wotar tuwitune, noowere wonetuwone, <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>T'afituhan t'afrawo k'irituhanwere k'irrawo tahdek'o bísh geyituwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>T'afituwaan t'afrawo k'iritwanwere k'irrawo tah b́dek'or «K'iro da'ewon k'oot'ewtsere!» ett guut'etso s'eenetwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>Mank'owere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">«K'irono! bín nkoshetuwo aawoke b́fa'oni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">K'irono! ash bín n t'afit ango ewuke?» etetuwe.<verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>K'iro bín b́koshet ango morre, morri angonuwere neme. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Ernmó nodoonz Iyesus Krstos weeron da'o noosh imetuwosh Ik'osh údo wotowe!<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Eshe mansha shuneets eshuwotso! kup'ar need'ore, ik keewonor shek'ek'ayere, doonzo finosh it shaatso datsmec'r b́woterawok'o dande'er, it eed'irawo jam aawo doonzo fino finosh kup'ore.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s">Iyerusalemitsi fa'a amantsuwotssh kakuwets tep'i gizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Amantsuwotssh giz kishi jango Gelatitsi Ik' moosh t imts bín bojisheeyirwok'on it were mank'o k'alwere. <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Taa twoor giz kisherawok'o ik ik gawiyotsi sanbat eenots ititsi ik iko b́datsiruwok'on kishde'er beezwe. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Taa itok twoor, amoosh falitúne it etts ashuwots it kishts gizo de'er Iyerusalem maants boametuwok'o bín bodeenet dabdabeyonton boon woshituwe. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>Taa tiamo b́ geyitka wotiyalo, taanton ametúne.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos finosh b́gawuts finwotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:21">Wosh. 19:21</ref> </char>
    </note> Mek'odoniiweeron amoosh t etirwotse manweeron t beshoor iki it weeron weetwe. <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Tiametu jamok tweerosh taash wotit tep'o taash it woshituwok'o daneraka itok teshetwe, daneraka jooshonor itnton beshiyosh falituwe, <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>And tbeshor iki b́weeron itn s'iilo geeratse, doonzontoh b́wotiyal múk'i geenzts gizeyosh itnton teshosh geyirwe.<verse eid="1CO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Ernmó P'ent'ek'ost'eyi bali aawo b́borfetsosh Efesonitse teshetwe. <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8-9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 19:8-10">Wosh. 19:8-10</ref> </char></note> Ayi eenonat shuu detsts fin fengesho taash k'eshewutsere, k'efirwotsu aynee.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:17">1 K'or. 4:17</ref> </char>
    </note> T'imotiwos itok b́woor shatalon itnton b́beetuwok'o bín tewu'ere, bíwere tikok'o doonzo fino finiruwe. <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Mansh konwor bín b́gac'eraawok'owa, bí eshwwotsnton t maants b́weetuwok'o tkotirwotse tiyok jeenon aanar b́weetwok'o b́weerosh bín geyitwon bín tewu'ere.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>No eshu Ap'los k'osh eshwwotsnton it b́ s'iiletwok'o kup'shdek'at k'onre b́teshi, bímó and it maants wosh eekeratse, bísh b́k'anoor weetwe.<verse eid="1CO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwaatsi izonat jamon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Maaw k'ayere, it amantsok'on kup'arr need'ore, kup'ore, aawo shuu'ere. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>It k'aliru jamo shunon k'aluwere.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:16">1 K'or. 1:16</ref> </char>
    </note> Ti eshwotso! Ist'ifanos maa ashuwots Akayiy datsatse amants shintswotsi bowottsok'onat amantsuwotssh finoshowere botoko beshidek't boimtsok'owo danfte. <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>Hanotsk'o ashuwotsnat bontonwere finon maawiru jamwotssh it aletwok'o kup'idek'at it baterawok'o gawirwe.<verse eid="1CO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Ist'ifanosna, Ferdonat's Akayik'oswere t maants bo waatsotse gene'owere, it tiyoke daatsewo itk'aztsotse bo it shegro taash shaptso s'eentsrne. <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>Bo t shayironat it shayiron kashirne, mansh hanotsk'o ashuwotsi dande'ere.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">Wosh. 18:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Isiyon fa'a Ik'i moowwots jamo itsh t'intsirune, Ak'ilnat K'irisp'iln, bomootse kakuweyiru krstiyani jamwotswere bo nibon jamo doonzo shúútson itsh t'intsirúne. <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Hanoke fa'a krstiyani jamwots jamo itsh t'intsirune, S'ayints joobewon jamó it atsatsewosh aatewere.<verse eid="1CO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Taa P'awlos jamáán t kishon itsh guut're.<verse eid="1CO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Doonzo shunawo b́beyal c'ashek wotowe! No doonzo wowe!<verse eid="1CO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>No doonz Iyesus s'aato itnton wotowe.<verse eid="1CO 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>T shuno Iyesus Krstosn it únetsnton wotowe.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
